<!--
  The filled counterpart of ic_upcoming, and the one asset navigation.md names
  as missing: "until it exists the bar cannot be consistent either way".

  The Material 3 Figma kit has no filled calendar under today, calendar, event
  or date, which is why the board draws all three destinations outlined. res/
  is not limited that way, so the app does what Material asks and fills the
  selected icon. navigation.md records the divergence.

  Drawn to match the ic_today / ic_today_filled pair rather than invented: the
  frame is ic_upcoming's own path, unchanged, and filling means the body
  becomes solid with the three day marks knocked out of it. Same silhouette,
  same optical weight as the other two filled icons in the bar.
-->
